-- title:
--   Original stopped physical full-cell small raw Gaussian combined positive source a.e. strongly measurable
-- statement:
--   For every original physical Gaussian stopped mesh and any positive small raw threshold δ, the positive part of the finite combined discounted source over wholly pre-stopping-time cells with |raw increment|<δ is a.e. strongly measurable. The source uses original Gaussian adaptedness, original stopping time, original dividend right-limits, and original top-cap C² smoothness, and supplies the missing measurability premise needed to integrate the a264 small-cell source under the positive energy majorant.
-- source:
--   Original a322 generic masked combined Gaussian source and original a163 actual stop fullcell endpoint positivity.

